<title>JAPAN: Nippon Engineering - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Engineering - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.54		vs	    3.19</p>
<p> Operating	  119    million    vs	   54    million</p>
<p> Current	     76    million    vs	   45    million</p>
<p> Net		   35    million    vs	   28    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.84 yen	  vs	    4.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Engineering Consultant Co Ltd is an engineering consultant specialising in roads and bridges.</p>
